        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>SOSS 220, Steel Invisible Door Hinges</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2\" Thick Door Invisible Door Hinge is for use on 2\" thick wood doors. The SOSS 220 Invisible Hinge features no visible knuckle when the door is closed meaning that it is concealed from view when the door is closed. Concealed Hinges like the SSOS-220 are most often used on doors where security is a must. When the door is closed, the hinge cannot be seen or tampered with; and when opened, the riveted hinge pin is non-removable. The installed hinge is firmly anchored in a deep, full mortise, which assists the screws in supporting the door, assuring a stronger door hinge installation. Package includes one (1) hinge with matching finish  #10 x 1-1/2\" wood screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-Finish-retro.jpg?v=1704442260\" width=\"230\" height=\"302\" border=\"0\" alt=\"SOSS 220 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available for <a href=\"/products/1-3-8-thick-door-invisible-door-hinge-soss-216\"><b>1-3/8\" thick doors SOSS 216 Hinge</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/invisible-door-hinge-for-1-3-4-inch-thick-doors-soss-218\"><b>1-3/4\" thick doors SOSS 218 Hinge</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/1-inch-thick-door-invisible-door-hinges-soss-208\"><b>1\" thick doors SOSS 208 Hinge</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the SOSS 220 Invisible Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Plate Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Minimum 2\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: High Strength Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SOSS-220-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262314\" target=\"new\"><b>SOSS 220 Hinge Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually (1 Door Hinge)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "2 Inch Thick Door Invisible Door Hinge, SOSS 220",
                "description": "SOSS 220, 2 Inch Thick Door Invisible Door Hinge -- The 2 Inch Thick Door Invisible Door Hinge is for use on 2 inch thick wood doors. The SOSS 220 Invisible Hinge features no visible knuckle when the door is closed meaning that it is concealed from view when the door is closed. Concealed Hinges like the SSOS-220 are most often used on doors where security is a must. Package includes one (1) hinge with matching finish  #10 x 1-1/2 inch wood screws.",
